            "slot": "s127",
            "repere": "Titre H3 · Whether you're trying to drink less alco",
            "text": "Whether you're trying to drink less alcohol or you just want to take your edibles in liquid form, Nowadays is the product to try… Although you might assume that the flavor would be overwhelmingly weed-y, that really wasn't the case; it has an enjoyable floral flavor that actually works really well in a variety of cocktail recipes.",
