            "repere": "Titre H3 · A new take on spirits, Nowadays is a can",
            "text": "A new take on spirits, Nowadays is a cannabis-infused juice of sorts that looks like liquor but without the harshness of alcohol—this drink will likely cure a hangover instead of causing one.",
