            "slot": "s137",
            "repere": "Titre H3 · I rarely smoke weed because I have a sup",
            "text": "I rarely smoke weed because I have a super low tolerance and often overdo it, leading to paranoid thoughts so overbearing, I can't be around people. But this option let me precisely measure consumption. It also cut out any coughing, smoke residue and accoutrement I'm often missing like a lighter, ashtray and proper ventilation. Consuming cannabis as easily as pouring a vodka soda? That's something I can get behind.”",
